    {
      "type": "Block",
      "value": "---\nesid: sec-Intl.Locale.prototype.getHourCycles\ndescription: >\n  When the locale has no region but has a subdivision (\"sd\") keyword, the\n  subdivision's region is used to derive the hour cycle preference.\ninfo: |\n  RegionPreference ( locale )\n  1. Let _region_ be GetLocaleRegion(_locale_).\n  2. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n    a. Set _region_ to CanonicalUnicodeSubdivision(_locale_, *\"sd\"*).\n    b. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n      i. Let _maximal_ be the result of the Add Likely Subtags algorithm applied\n         to _locale_. If an error is signaled, set _maximal_ to _locale_.\n      ...\n  ...\nfeatures: [Intl.Locale, Intl.Locale-info]\n---",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 785
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " In order not to rely on a particular implementation's locale data, this test",
      "start": 787,
      "end": 866
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " searches for a suitable locale without a region subtag, but with a",
      "start": 867,
      "end": 936
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " subdivision (\"sd\" extension) whose region would influence the supported hour",
      "start": 937,
      "end": 1016
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " cycles.",
      "start": 1017,
      "end": 1027
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "",
      "start": 1028,
      "end": 1030
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Each candidate below is a locale with a subdivision extension but no region",
      "start": 1031,
      "end": 1109
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " subtag, together with a locale that names that subdivision's region",
      "start": 1110,
      "end": 1180
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " explicitly (e.g. \"en-u-sd-gbeng\" has subdivision \"gbeng\", whose region is",
      "start": 1181,
      "end": 1257
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " \"GB\", so \"en-GB\"). Because such a locale has no region subtag,",
      "start": 1258,
      "end": 1323
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " RegionPreference must derive its region from the subdivision. Its hour cycles",
      "start": 1324,
      "end": 1404
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " must therefore be identical to those of the paired region locale. An",
      "start": 1405,
      "end": 1476
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " incorrect implementation might instead ignore the \"sd\" extension and apply",
      "start": 1477,
      "end": 1554
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Add Likely Subtags to the bare language, giving \"en-Latn-US\".",
      "start": 1555,
      "end": 1619
    }
  ],
